# Purpose: Normalize incoming event records while the stdin listener stays open.
# Inputs: stdin supplies one JSON event per line.
# Outputs: stdout emits a compact normalized event for each input line.
listen to stdin
whenever a line arrives as record
  then jq with flags ["-c"] and filter "{event_id: .id, occurred_at: .at, kind: .type, source: .source, actor: (.actor // null)}"
